{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t截至下午6時，警方接獲超過300人報案，指兩間寄賣店分別懷疑拖欠寄賣款項，涉款共約4190萬元。<br/>\n<br/>\n警方表示，就銅鑼灣羅素街一間店鋪懷疑拖欠寄賣款項，警方暫時共接獲207人報案，涉案金額約3000萬元。<br/>\n<br/>\n另外，就中區夏愨道一間店鋪懷疑拖欠寄賣款項的案件，警方暫時共接獲96人報案，涉案金額約1190萬元。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：鍾慧儀\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:36:31.002439+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:11:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T21:49:26.136714+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:29:50.327615+00:00","content_hash":"653e2866f6ec123f6deb47ad6ccfdd79eb9cc4656f7bf7106be0bdb2e2c1147b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}